# Innioasis Y1: the Y2 boot scripts that are safe on Y1 hardware (docs/planning/Y1-SYSTEM-PLAN.md §2), with
# USB networking and SSH (docs/planning/Y1-NETWORK-PLAN.md), Reborn (docs/planning/Y1-REBORN-PLAN.md) and the
# Y2's power daemon (docs/planning/Y1-POWER-PLAN.md, D2): S03y1-data prepares Reborn's RAM /data first,
# S04y2-power runs the daemon with the Y1 battery profile and policy.
